{"info": {"address1": "JSW Centre", "address2": "3rd Floor Bandra Kurla Complex, Near MMRDA Grounds Kolivery Village, MMRDA Area, Bandra (East)", "city": "Mumbai", "zip": "400051", "country": "India", "phone": "91 22 4286 3115", "fax": "91 22 2650 2001", "website": "https://www.jswcement.in", "industry": "Building Materials", "industryKey": "building-materials", "industryDisp": "Building Materials", "sector": "Basic Materials", "sectorKey": "basic-materials", "sectorDisp": "Basic Materials", "longBusinessSummary": "JSW Cement Limited manufactures and sells cement and cement-related products under the JSW Cement brand in India. The company offers Portland slag, ordinary Portland, composite, environment-friendly, Portland pozzolana, and water-repellant cement products. It also provides construction chemicals comprising precision steel grouts, mortars, and waterproofing compounds, as well as tile adhesives, grouts, and cleaners; cementitious materials, including ground granulated blast furnace slag (GGBS) and microfine GGBS; aggregates consisting of screened slag; ready-mix concrete under the JSW Concrete brand; and clinkers. In addition, the company offers concrete laboratory testing services. It sells its products through a network of dealers and sub-dealers, as well as warehouses. The company was incorporated in 2006 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India. JSW Cement Limited is a subsidiary of Adarsh Advisory Services Private Limited.", "fullTimeEmployees": 1618, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Nilesh  Narwekar", "age": 54, "title": "Whole-Time Director & CEO", "yearBorn": 1971, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Sneha  Bindra", "title": "Company Secretary & Compliance Officer", "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Hitendra R. Jariwala", "title": "Chief Marketing Officer", "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Parth Sajjan Jindal", "age": 35, "titl